      "culture": "amharic",
      "text": "ድመት ማዳበር መጣለል አይደለም",
      "translation_en": "Petting a cat is not the same as ignoring it (every effort has meaning).",
      "meaning": "Small consistent efforts matter; do not dismiss them.",
